+=== 1. Dynamic Client Registration (RFC 7591) ===
+POST /oauth/register HTTP/1.1
+Host: kanban.local
+Content-Type: application/json
+
+{
+  "client_name": "Claude Code Desktop",
+  "redirect_uris": [
+    "http://127.0.0.1:8080/callback"
+  ]
+}
+
+HTTP/1.1 201 Created
+Content-Type: application/json
+
+{
+  "client_id": "client_c1a2b3c4d5e6",
+  "client_name": "Claude Code Desktop",
+  "client_type": "public",
+  "redirect_uris": [
+    "http://127.0.0.1:8080/callback"
+  ],
+  "status": "active",
+  "created_at": "2026-11-12T08:00:00Z"
+}
+
+============================================================
+
+=== 2. Authorization Request & Consent (RFC 6749 / RFC 7636) ===
+GET /oauth/authorize?response_type=code&client_id=client_c1a2b3c4d5e6&redirect_uri=http%3A%2F%2F127.0.0.1%3A8080%2Fcallback&code_challenge=dBjftJeZ4CVP-mB92K27uhbUJU1p1r_wW1gFWFOEjXk&code_challenge_method=S256&resource=https%3A%2F%2Fkanban.local%2Fmcp%2Fagent&scope=agent%3Aread+agent%3Awrite&state=xyz123 HTTP/1.1
+Host: kanban.local
+Cookie: __Host-kb_session=<REDACTED_SESSION_COOKIE>
+
+HTTP/1.1 200 OK
+Content-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8
+
+<!-- Rendered accessible HTML consent screen displaying client name, surface badge AGENT, scopes, project selector -->
+
+POST /oauth/authorize/decision HTTP/1.1
+Host: kanban.local
+Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
+Cookie: __Host-kb_session=<REDACTED_SESSION_COOKIE>
+
+client_id=client_c1a2b3c4d5e6&action=approve&scopes=agent%3Aread&scopes=agent%3Awrite&code_challenge=dBjftJeZ4CVP-mB92K27uhbUJU1p1r_wW1gFWFOEjXk&code_challenge_method=S256&resource=https%3A%2F%2Fkanban.local%2Fmcp%2Fagent&redirect_uri=http%3A%2F%2F127.0.0.1%3A8080%2Fcallback&state=xyz123
+
+HTTP/1.1 302 Found
+Location: http://127.0.0.1:8080/callback?code=<REDACTED_AUTH_CODE>&state=xyz123
+
+============================================================
+
+=== 3. Authorization Code Token Exchange with PKCE S256 (RFC 6749 / RFC 7636) ===
+POST /oauth/token HTTP/1.1
+Host: kanban.local
+Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
+
+grant_type=authorization_code&client_id=client_c1a2b3c4d5e6&code=<REDACTED_AUTH_CODE>&code_verifier=<REDACTED_CODE_VERIFIER>&redirect_uri=http%3A%2F%2F127.0.0.1%3A8080%2Fcallback&resource=https%3A%2F%2Fkanban.local%2Fmcp%2Fagent
+
+HTTP/1.1 200 OK
+Content-Type: application/json
+Cache-Control: no-store
+Pragma: no-cache
+
+{
+  "access_token": "<REDACTED_ES256_JWT_ACCESS_TOKEN>",
+  "token_type": "Bearer",
+  "expires_in": 900,
+  "refresh_token": "<REDACTED_REFRESH_TOKEN>",
+  "scope": "agent:read agent:write"
+}
+
+============================================================
+
+=== 4. Refresh Token Grant with Rotation (RFC 6749 Section 6) ===
+POST /oauth/token HTTP/1.1
+Host: kanban.local
+Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
+
+grant_type=refresh_token&client_id=client_c1a2b3c4d5e6&refresh_token=<REDACTED_REFRESH_TOKEN>
+
+HTTP/1.1 200 OK
+Content-Type: application/json
+Cache-Control: no-store
+Pragma: no-cache
+
+{
+  "access_token": "<REDACTED_NEW_ES256_JWT_ACCESS_TOKEN>",
+  "token_type": "Bearer",
+  "expires_in": 900,
+  "refresh_token": "<REDACTED_ROTATED_REFRESH_TOKEN>",
+  "scope": "agent:read agent:write"
+}
+
+============================================================
+
+=== 5. RFC 7009 Token Revocation ===
+POST /oauth/revoke HTTP/1.1
+Host: kanban.local
+Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
+
+token=<REDACTED_ROTATED_REFRESH_TOKEN>&token_type_hint=refresh_token
+
+HTTP/1.1 200 OK
+Content-Type: application/json
+
+{}
